Submitted by:            OpenMandriva
Date:                    2026-07-04
Initial Package Version: 1.4.4
Upstream Status:         Pending
Origin:                  Local fix for poppler 26.07.0 API removals
Description:             Fixes building Inkscape 1.4.4 with poppler 26.07 and
                         later. Poppler removed Object::streamGetDict() and
                         Object::arrayGetNF(), and changed Catalog::indexToLabel
                         to take std::string* instead of GooString* (GooString
                         now privately inherits std::string).

